  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 411 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The label for oxacillin sodium (NDC 55150012715) lists Aurobindo Pharma Limited as a registered manufacturing plant (FEI 3004446312).",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1286862 of that plant ended on 2025-09-05 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI).",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 411 days before today's posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E9", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same label also lists Eugia SEZ Private Limited (FEI 3011905047) as a registered plant for analysis, manufacture, and pack, whose most recent inspection (1081040) ended 2019-03-01 with a Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) classification.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 390 units with 26 days on hand at current use, while Corvale Lakeside holds 48 units with 12 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from Armas Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and uses a plant last inspected VAI on 2019-02-14.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    }
  ]
}
